  "title": "Find deals"
 },
 "description": "Launch deals on FastDrop: discounts, extended trials and promo codes that makers offer people who find their product here. Use when the user hunts for a deal, discount, coupon or promo code on an AI tool, app or MCP server. Each product's deal has the offer, an optional code, and a claimUrl. exclusive is the maker's claim, not verified - say so if you mention it. Deals never affect rank.",
